      "body": "When uploading water quality data for the Sonde dashboard card, the oldest data upload is showing. We should display the latest data point in the dashboard card. In [https://aqualink.org/sites/2188](https://aqualink.org/sites/2188), for example, the data upload with the data from 2022 is appearing. I’ve uploaded data in another upload that has data points from 2024. The most recent data points should populate the dashboard card. \r\n\r\n<img width=\"1328\" alt=\"Screenshot 2024-09-13 at 12 00 15 PM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/db2bb2ca-af5e-485d-8544-f6bd80317334\">\r\n",
